{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01Eic2kpKBFpYRaximQVKDYn","type":"tool_result","content":"void blake256_update( blakestate256 *S, const u8 *data, u64 datalen ) {\n\n  int left=S->buflen >> 3; \n  int fill=64 - left;\n   \n  if( left && ( ((datalen >> 3) & 0x3F) >= fill ) ) {\n    memcpy( (void*) (S->buf + left), (void*) data, fill );\n    S->t[0] += 512;\n    if (S->t[0] == 0) S->t[1]++;      \n    blake256_compress( S, S->buf );\n    data += fill;\n    datalen  -= (fill << 3);       \n    left = 0;\n  }\n\n  while( datalen >= 512 ) {\n    S->t[0] += 512;\n    if (S->t[0] == 0) S->t[1]++;\n    blake256_compress( S, data );\n    data += 64;\n    datalen -= 512;\n  }\n  \n  if( datalen > 0 ) {\n    memcpy( (void*) (S->buf + left), (void*) data, datalen>>3 );\n    S->buflen = (left<<3) + datalen;\n  }\n  else S->buflen=0;\n}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01QTTpf9ghYJ8zwdkm3QDPFT","session_id":"eb87ec4e-54f9-48e5-a5c6-d85aefaf339c","uuid":"2da8d499-59d6-4ea3-aadf-ad85a44ce3bc","timestamp":"2026-09-02T12:06:08.329Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Fix blake backend bugs"}
